Magicbane's engraving is as good (as enduring) as engravings with wands
of digging or magic markers, but not as good as a burned engraving (done
with fire or lightning). You can assume that a dust scribbling will not
allow a single turn of fight without erasing it, and burned engravings
will not erase at all, though a semi-permanent engraving[*] will allow you
to fight, typically many turns, but not guaranteed. In critical situations
you should check that type of engraving after every attack round; since
Magicbane is a one-turn engraver you can refresh the engraving, or add
to the existing engraving, usually done if the critters temporarily left
the vicinity.

[*] Magicbane/athame (1 turn), wand of digging (1 turn), hard gemstone or
ring with hard gemstone (8 turns), magic marker (1 turn).

